card
  text React is a JavaScript library for building user interfaces. You compose UI from function components and describe state with hooks; React handles the rendering and keeps the UI in sync as state changes. The modern ecosystem (createRoot, Suspense, Server Components) builds on the same component model.
  link React http://facebook.github.io/react
